    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you run a bee motel and solve the clues to find your guests among dozens of other bees? Enjoy some cozy, relaxing moments with the sweetest little bees you\u2019ve ever met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imka, Hop and you are the team of the Bee Welcome Hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them find your special guests among dozens of similar bees!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837750/extras/87ef6e77c9aa19354180b2847d59d83c.poster.avif?t=1739290190\" width=422 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837750/extras/87ef6e77c9aa19354180b2847d59d83c.webm?t=1739290190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837750/extras/87ef6e77c9aa19354180b2847d59d83c.mp4?t=1739290190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a Surfer Bee, a Honey Dabber Bee or a Unicorn Bee, Imka's bee hotel is open to everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to be the best bee hotelier? Come and find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of different bees!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beach bees!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dancing bees!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowing alien bees!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and many more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beardshakers wish you a lot of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anke, Bene and Michael</p>",
